  "ruleText": "Ve-H 205.01 Construction of Rules Governing Adjudicative Proceedings. Parts Ve-H 205 through Ve-H 216 shall be construed to secure the just, accurate and efficient resolution of all disputes.\n\nSource. #8951, eff 7-21-07",
